{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/803591-spirit-brainstorming-toronto-surroundings","id":803591,"title":"Spirit Brainstorming - Toronto & Surroundings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-07T23:06:17-08:00","id":803591,"title":"Spirit Brainstorming - Toronto & Surroundings","content":"Need some assistance, friends. Working on the idea of Toronto as a Hunting Ground, and would love some ideas for interesting spirits to populate the place with. Thoughts on what the spiritual landscape would look like are very welcome, and if you've got ideas for specific spirits, I'd love to hear them!<br /> <br /> EDIT: To give some context, the apparent tech boom and the diversity of the city seem like two things that are interesting and could have implications for the city's Spirits. Toronto is apparently a very safe city as well, so there isn't that much crime or bother going on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":159,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","user":"Leetsepeak","date":". 01-08-2016, 02:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T19:37:50-08:00","id":804933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/803591-spirit-brainstorming-toronto-surroundings#post803591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Toronto is apparently a very safe city as well, so there isn't that much crime or bother going on.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is something you could work on. The Shadow might be patrolled by safety spirits that methodically eradicate any sign of disorder. There could be a whole court of spirits reporting to a single mainframe entity, a hivemind of obsessive security. This could be a very dangerous place for Uratha, since they are violent by their natures. A pack would need a lot of effort carving their way through this heavy guarded Hisil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5446-binaly","name":"BinAly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5446_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T19:45:55-08:00","id":804937,"title":"","content":"Ever read the Web novel Pact? It gives a ton of awesome ideas on the Toronto supernatural community, from Infernal Demons to ghosts and general Spirits. Even a few Abyssals and some entities that could be Beasts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T22:55:24-08:00","id":805033,"title":"","content":"If you're making a Hunting Ground setting for Toronto, I am curious about possible hooks for crossing over with a Changeling setting, seeing as the Courts of Scheherezade might benefit from drawing on the lore of the Uratha to fuel their Bulwark. In fact, the Jade Court and Silver Court could have the biggest possibility for ties with any werewolf protectorates in the city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T07:40:11-08:00","id":805231,"title":"","content":"But yeah. Moving more on topic with this thread, I'd probably also picture the Shadow of Toronto as a place where concepts like equivalency and give-and-take are very prevalent. The city's status as Canada's commercial center and an international hub for business and finance could be reflected by many of the local spirit courts adhering to a (semi-)corporate hierarchy, presided over perhaps by a 'board' of powerful spirits (Rank 5+).<br /> <br /> So in addition to having to deal with spirits of safety (and similar concepts such as justice, law, and order), Uratha who live in Toronto have to navigate a Shadow ruled over by a vicious bureaucracy, taking heed of what <i>gathra</i> should be on hand to best appease whichever spirit they are seeking out for aid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}